      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53b5b3fafb2dc65f",
      "translationZh": "这里，我们展示如何对随机张量使用远程 VAE。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "340f463033e0fd5d",
      "translationZh": "代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fe9daf7e85681c3",
      "translationZh": "Flux 的用法略有不同。Flux 的潜变量经过打包，因此我们需要传入高度和宽度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "340f463033e0fd5d",
