      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33e2221266a61f22",
      "translationZh": "但我们希望在实际的流水线中使用 VAE，得到真正的图像，而不是随机噪声。下面的示例展示了如何用 SD v1.5 实现这一点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "340f463033e0fd5d",
      "translationZh": "代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d9b2d0c9022cab6",
      "translationZh": "下面是另一个使用 Flux 的示例。",
